<title>UK: UK rice - Jan 29.</title>
<headline>UK rice - Jan 29.</headline>
<text>
<p>EC milled American type long grain 10 pct broken cif U.K. (Incl EC Levy) Feb 625 stg per long ton.</p>
<p>Italian No.1 milled, round grain, 10 pct broken cif dlvd London (Free of EC Levy) Feb 490 stg per tonne.</p>
<p>Brown/Cargo Long Grain Rice. C and F EC ports. Subject to EC Levies Dlrs per tonne unless stated.</p>
<p>U.S. No.2 Brown 4 pct broken Feb $17.25 dollars per 100 LBS.</p>
</text>
